## إضافة Circuit Breaker (ضروري للإنتاج)

```java
// باستخدام Resilience4j
CircuitBreaker circuitBreaker = CircuitBreaker.ofDefaults("enrichmentService");

Supplier<EnrichedData> decoratedSupplier = CircuitBreaker
    .decorateSupplier(circuitBreaker,
        () -> enrichmentService.enrich(message));

EnrichedData result = Try.ofSupplier(decoratedSupplier)
    .recover(CallNotPermittedException.class, ex -> EnrichedData.empty())
    .recover(Exception.class, ex -> EnrichedData.empty())
    .get();
```

